cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Maximal filters in the lattice of closed convex sets: Lean 4 formalization"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization accompanying the paper "Maximal filters in the lattice
  of closed convex sets". Maximal filters of the lattice of closed convex
  subsets of R^n are classified by an affine subspace, a linear subspace
  containing its direction space, and a vector space order on that subspace in
  which the direction space is order-convex.
